WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,610
What are you doing here playing games? Playing games? Do you think so?

2
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:08,980
Don't overdo it

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,860
Don't worry, I know it well

4
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,740
You don’t know who is leading the demolition?

5
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:23,020
Who told you to hit someone? You always know, right?

6
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,540
You can hit me again

7
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:26,140
I really can't say this

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,040
You can't say so, right?

9
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:37,160
Okay, can you tell me it’s Brother Long?

10
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:42,940
It was Brother Long who asked me to do it. Brother Long, who is Brother Long?

11
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,060
Brother Long is the boss in the south of the city.

12
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,980
We are just little Loulou in his eyes

13
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,660
He called me that day

14
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:49,860
Let me do something for him

15
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,020
to teach someone a lesson

16
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:54,540
If he asks me to do something, do I dare not to agree? If I dare not to agree,

17
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:56,100
He would be hacked to death the next day

18
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:57,660
He was also responsible for the demolition.

19
00:00:58,210 --> 00:00:59,130
I really don't know this

20
00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:00,490
I just hit people

21
00:01:00,610 --> 00:01:01,850
Demolition is not my turn

22
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,440
My dad is at Dongyunshan Cemetery

23
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,080
Bring gifts and kowtow

24
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:11,360
Smell, forget about it tomorrow morning

25
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,520
smashed things

26
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:21,040
A lot of money will be paid to the boss, yes, yes, yes
